# LAST_ACK + receive ACK -> CLOSED. The connection is fully torn down.
define the potential action<define-lang.org:tcp:/transitions/last_ack_recv_ack> {
    it also assigns the position</states/last_ack>.
    it also assigns the position</states/closed>.

    define the position<run>.

    it happens when {
        the position<run> has a particle.
    } and it does {
        move the particle in position</states/last_ack> to position</states/closed>.
        destroy the particle in position<run>.
    }
}
